443	     * The canonical region for a city, derived from the fixed city-to-region table
444	     * ({@code Sydney -> NSW}, {@code Melbourne -> VIC}, {@code Brisbane -> QLD}), or
445	     * {@link #UNKNOWN_REGION} when the city is not in the table. This is the single
446	     * source of the city-to-region mapping, shared by every rule that is keyed by
447	     * region so the mapping is never re-derived elsewhere.
